        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>60\" Modern Stainless Steel Rectangular Offset Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 60 Inch Center to Center Satin Stainless Steel Door Pull can be mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. Choose from thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted (just make sure to order 2 pulls if you choose to mount this way). This 5 foot pull is made out of durable stainless steel with a satin stainless steel finish. It is ADA compliant. The 60 inch Modern Stainless Steel Rectangular Offset Pull is great for any door where a clean, modern look is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available:  <a href=\"/products/24-inch-stainless-steel-rectangular-offset-pull\"><b>24\" Modern Rectangular Offset Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/36-inch-stainless-steel-rectangular-offset-pull\"><b>36\" Modern Rectangular Offset Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/48-inch-stainless-steel-rectangular-offset-pull\"><b>48\" Modern Rectangular Offset Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-20T60EB-specifications.gif?v=1704354503\" width=\"91\" height=\"367\" border=\"0\" alt=\"60 inch Stainless Rectangular Offset Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 60\" Modern Rectangular Offset Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 60\" (1542 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 3\" (76.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4\" (102 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1\" x 3/4\" Rectangular</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "60 Inch Center to Center Satin Stainless Steel Door Pull",
                "description": "60 Inch Center to Center Satin Stainless Steel Door Pull - The 60 Inch Center to Center Satin Stainless Steel Door Pull can be mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. Choose from thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted (just make sure to order 2 pulls if you choose to mount this way). This 5 foot pull is made out of durable stainless steel with a satin stainless steel finish. It is ADA compliant. The 60 inch Modern Stainless Steel Rectangular Offset Pull is great for any door where a clean, modern look is desired.",
